          "message": {
            "text": "The page, parameterized page, landing redirect, and nav-index routes read Page, Edge, and Panel rows directly without a grid.read authorization decision. A capless authenticated user received page content and the nav catalog, including page metadata and panel URL identifiers that chain into the panel-fragment bypass."
          },
